{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And this is what you shall do to them.</b> To Aaron and to his sons." "There is no difference between קח and לקח, as in צק לעם ויאכלו (II Kings 4:41), and also יְצק בו מים (Ezekiel 24:3)." "Because he mentioned עם together with פר בן בקר, it indicates that it is not large, and likewise בני יונה (Leviticus 5:7)." "שעיר עזים (Leviticus 4:23), and the ram is larger than the lamb, and the proof is the libation, which is a third of the hin, and for the lamb a quarter of it."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:57.037303893Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}